<title>BRAZIL: France to take up option to buy 30 Embraer Tucanos.</title>
<headline>France to take up option to buy 30 Embraer Tucanos.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French air force will take up an option to buy 30 Tucano aircraft from Brazilian aviation firm Embraer, a senior Brazilian Foreign Ministry official said.</p>
<p>Marcelo Jardim, director general of the ministry's Europe department, told reporters the French air force had already bought 50 Tucanos.</p>
<p>&quot;President (Jacques) Chirac confirmed the purchase of the other 30,&quot; Jardim said.  </p>
<p>Jardim said the purchase would begin &quot;immediately.&quot;</p>
<p>Chirac was in Brazil for a 48-hour official visit last week.</p>
<p>(( -- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
